{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】青衣油庫對開發生撞船意外，初步約20人受傷，其中2人傷勢較重。</p>\n<p>有救護員使用擔架協助傷者，現場亦有消防車及救護車協助救援。早上約9時21分，一艘上環去蛇口的客輪途經青衣油庫對出海面時，懷疑與浮塢相撞，初步約20人受傷，十多輛救護車及大批救援員在場協助。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:03:54.251659+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:36:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T00:37:12.457803+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:57:32.283717+00:00","content_hash":"7640f63666ef03099f90ae11fd035462e134262f1d32714c674d3bddf77e7d09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:03:54.251659+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}